      "content": "it's hard to take joy in anything when the core of who i thought i was is just gone. it feels like i'm just playing a role in a play i didn't want to be in. if the only thing that gave my life meaning was being at the top, and i'm not... isn't it just more logical to accept that the game is over? like, why keep going through the motions if the prize isn't even there?",
